# ─── RecoverIQ — Root Environment Reference ──────────────────────────────────────
#
# This file documents the top-level project.
# Each application has its own .env.example:
#
#   backend/.env.example   — backend secrets and config
#   frontend/.env.example  — frontend public config
#
# Copy the relevant .env.example to .env in each sub-directory and fill in values.
# NEVER commit .env files to source control.
